OL,3,GNEWSAThief who targeted Edgar Davids
OL,4,Amisses sentencing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fraudster who pawned ex-Premier
OL,7,FLeague star Edgar Davids' #188,000
OL,8,Fmodern art collection has failed to
OL,9,Fattend her sentencing hearing, claiming
OL,10,Fshe was struck on the head with a bag
OL,11,Fon her way to the airport.
OL,13,FNabila Habiby, 39, obtained #31,500 in
OL,14,Floans by handing over 37 works of art
OL,15,Fbelonging to Davids, after he had
OL,16,Ftrusted her to put his possessions into
OL,17,Fstorage during a house move.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
