OL,3,GNEWSAThief who targeted Edgar Davids
OL,4,Amisses sentencing
OL,5,
OL,6,FHabiby, a wealth manager, pleaded
OL,7,Fguilty in September 2025 to two counts
OL,8,Fof fraud and was bailed with a warning
OL,9,Fthat she could face up to 34 months in
OL,10,Fprison.
OL,12,FThe judge ordered Habiby to attend Wood
OL,13,FGreen Crown Court on 23 September for
OL,14,Fsentencing and to provide a full
OL,15,Fmedical report explaining her absence.
